  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Let It Bleed**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **High Hopes Low**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Danger $$$**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Willoughby's Beach**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Dead Beat**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Crookedile**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2011-12-09.KG** (recommended): audience recording; 6 songs; 25 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Christopher attended the festival ten years prior, finding the young band merely decent then [1]\n- The band has transformed significantly since that earlier festival appearance, becoming something else now [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2011-12-09.KG**: taped by Christopher Jacques; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded on iRiver iHP-120, processed in Sony Sound Forge 8, shared by Christopher [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2011-12-09 Meredith Supernatural Amphitheatre, Meredith, VIC, Australia](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-december-9-2011-meredith-supernatural-amphitheatre-meredith-vic-australia.html) [8]\n- Poster by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2011-12-09 Meredith Supernatural Amphitheatre, Meredith, VIC, Australia](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-december-9-2011-meredith-supernatural-amphitheatre-meredith-vic-australia.html) [9]",
